    "message": "fix(lineage): record partial indexes to rollback journal, CP-001 (#12163)\n\n\u0417\u0430\u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f\u0435\u0442 PR #12142. \u0418\u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0435\u0442 \u043e\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043a\u0438 mypy \u0438 \u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0435\u0442 \u0430\u0440\u0442\u0435\u0444\u0430\u043a\u0442\u044b CI\n(lint-arch, docs-governance, mypy, arch-tests)\n\n---\n*PR created automatically by Jules for task\n[3532575012461822767](https://jules.google.com/task/3532575012461822767)\nstarted by @SatoryKono*\n\n----\n## Summary by Gitar\n\n- **New batch processing services:**\n- Added `operation_errors` policy and\n`RecordProcessorWriteCollaborators` under `batch_processing`\n- **Historical replay and control plane:**\n- Added `historical_replay_identity`, `composite_replay_evidence`, and\nreplay/artifact trace field definitions\n- **OpenAlex pagination:**\n    - Added bounded `iter_query_results` that fails on repeated cursors\n- **Data sources:**\n- Added `_derived_assay_source` shared mechanics for assay-derived\nsources\n- **Tests and quality artifacts:**\n- Added quarantine partition, VCR routing, and PR lane tests;\nregenerated coverage and governance reports\n\n<sub>This will update automatically on new commits.</sub>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: codex <codex@local>\nCo-authored-by: coderabbitai[bot] <136622811+coderabbitai[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
